{
  "$schema": "../protocol.schema.json",
  "component": "Input",
  "protocol": 1,
  "status": "draft",
  "summary": "单行文本输入。根节点有两种形态：无前后缀时根就是原生 input；有前后缀或清除时根是包裹元素，原生 input 退为 __field。这是本协议第一次出现结构随模式变化。",
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "class": "sm-input",
      "tag": [
        "input",
        "span"
      ],
      "required": true,
      "data": {
        "variant": {
          "kind": "variant",
          "enum": [
            "outlined",
            "filled",
            "borderless"
          ],
          "required": true,
          "default": "outlined"
        },
        "size": {
          "kind": "variant",
          "enum": [
            "sm",
            "md",
            "lg"
          ],
          "required": true,
          "default": "md"
        },
        "status": {
          "kind": "config",
          "enum": [
            "default",
            "error",
            "warning"
          ],
          "required": true,
          "default": "default"
        },
        "disabled": {
          "kind": "boolean"
        },
        "readonly": {
          "kind": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "interaction": [
        "hover",
        "focus-within"
      ]
    },
    "parts": {
      "prefix": {
        "class": "sm-input__prefix",
        "tag": "span",
        "required": false,
        "order": 1,
        "condition": "传入 prefix（仅 span 模式）"
      },
      "field": {
        "class": "sm-input__field",
        "tag": "input",
        "required": false,
        "order": 2,
        "condition": "根为 span 时必填；根为 input 时不渲染",
        "attrs": {
          "type": {
            "required": true,
            "default": "text"
          }
        },
        "aria": {
          "aria-invalid": "status=error 时必填 true"
        }
      },
      "clear": {
        "class": "sm-input__clear",
        "tag": "span",
        "required": false,
        "order": 3,
        "condition": "allowClear 且有值（仅 span 模式）",
        "aria": {
          "aria-hidden": "true"
        }
      },
      "suffix": {
        "class": "sm-input__suffix",
        "tag": "span",
        "required": false,
        "order": 3,
        "condition": "传入 suffix 且当前无 clear（仅 span 模式）"
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "appliesTo": {
      "rootTag": "span"
    },
    "root": {
      "display": "inline-flex",
      "align-items": "normal",
      "height": {
        "$token": "control.height"
      }
    },
    "row": {
      "parts": [
        "prefix",
        "field",
        "clear|suffix"
      ]
    },
    "parts": {
      "field": {
        "flex": "1 1 auto",
        "line-height": {
          "$token": "control.lineHeight"
        }
      },
      "prefix": {
        "line-height": {
          "$token": "control.lineHeight"
        }
      },
      "suffix": {
        "line-height": {
          "$token": "control.lineHeight"
        }
      },
      "clear": {
        "box": {
          "width": {
            "$token": "input.clear.size"
          },
          "height": {
            "$token": "input.clear.size"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "invariants": [
    "根节点只有两种合法形态：input（无前后缀）或 span（有前后缀/清除）；不得出现第三种。",
    "根为 span 时，field 必须是 root 的直接子节点且恰好一个。",
    "根为 input 时，不渲染任何 part，也不得再套包裹元素。",
    "disabled 时原生 disabled 必须落在承载文本编辑的那个元素上（input 或 field），且根节点同时带 data-disabled。",
    "readonly 时原生 readonly 必须落在承载文本编辑的元素上，且根节点同时带 data-readonly。",
    "status=error 时，承载文本编辑的元素必须带 aria-invalid=\"true\"。",
    "clear 与 suffix 共用尾部槽位，同一时刻只允许一个存在。",
    "禁止用 div + contenteditable 模拟输入框。",
    "根为 span 时，prefix / field / clear|suffix 必须是同一个父节点的直接子节点，顺序即声明顺序。",
    "清除按钮的盒尺寸随 size 档位取值（见 tokens.size.json 的 input.clear.size），不得写死在别处。"
  ],
  "a11y": [
    "可访问名称来自关联的 label 或 aria-label，不能只依赖 placeholder。",
    "clear 不可聚焦、不进入 Tab 序列；键盘清除走 Esc 或 Delete。",
    "错误状态必须同时体现在 aria-invalid 上，不能只改边框颜色。"
  ],
  "notes": "为什么允许双形态：无前后缀时如果仍套一层包裹，根节点的 display 与盒子模型就会和参考实现分叉（inline-block vs inline-flex），L3 永远对不上；而套包裹又会污染纯文本输入的语义。两种形态各自最自然，协议选择承认这一点而不是强行统一。layout 里的约束都是「结果约束」：允许实现用不同手法（槽位容器、align-self、行盒）达成同一条中线，校验看最终结果。"
}
